id: static_counter
category: classes
difficulty: 3
libs:
checker: exact
timeout: 10
--- prompt
Write an Objeck program with a class Widget that keeps a static (class-level) counter of how many instances have been created, incremented in the constructor. Create three Widget objects in Main, then print `Widgets: 3` using a static function that returns the counter.
--- expected
Widgets: 3
--- reference
class Widget {
	@count : static : Int;

	New() {
		@count += 1;
	}

	function : GetCount() ~ Int {
		return @count;
	}

	function : Main(args : String[]) ~ Nil {
		Widget->New();
		Widget->New();
		Widget->New();
		"Widgets: {$Widget->GetCount()}"->PrintLine();
	}
}
